    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BROE auctioneers are delighted to present this 3 bed semi detached family home to the market in the highly sought after Cherrywood Drive. No. 177 is brought to the market in great condition with well-appointed accommodation and spacious room proportions, which boast numerous advantages. The accommodation consists of extended entrance hallway, lounge, kitchen/dining room and French doors to private walled low maintenance south facing rear garden. Upstairs there are three bedrooms and main family bathroom. Just a short stroll from Clondalkin Village and close to an abundance of amenities including shops, schools, and leisure facilities and only moments away from the M50 motorway and Luas light railway, which enables easy access to all parts of the country. This superb property has a lot to offer, and early viewing is recommended.\r\n\r\nContact BROE auctioneers to register your interest."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nEntrance hall\t\t3.09m x 1.36m\tLaminated wood flooring, ceiling coving, alarm panel.\r\n\r\n\t\r\nLounge\t\t\t4.14m x 3.91m\tFeature cast iron open fireplace, ceiling. coving, laminated wood flooring, \r\n\r\n\r\nKitchen/ Dining Room\t4.78m x 3.85m \tGreat range of modern floor and eye level units to include most appliances, tile flooring, French doors to \t\t\t\t\t\tsouth facing rear garden.\r\n\r\n\r\nFirst Floor\t\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n(1) Bedroom\t\t\t3.06m x 3.21m\twith built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\n\r\n(2) Bedroom\t\t\t3.96m x 3.00m\twith built in wardrobes.\r\n\r\n\r\n(3) Bedroom\t\t\t3.24m x 2.17m\tStand alone robe. \r\n\r\n\r\nBathroom\t\t\t2.63m x 1.70m \tW.C, W.H.B & vanity unit, bath with Mira sprint electric \tshower, fully tiled walls and floor.\r\n\r\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tGas fired central heating.\r\n•\tDouble glazed windows.\r\n•\tNo onward chain.\r\n•\tAmple off-street parking.\r\n•\tExcellent location.\r\n•\tLow maintenance south facing rear garden."
      },
